> [guix-8.20.0] S s303 GET rc=0 status=302 location=/s amount=1 r0=http://127.0.0.1:35343/s utf8=yes
> [guix-8.20.0] S rel-abs.head HEAD rc=0 status=302 location=/x/y?z=1 amount=2 r0=http://127.0.0.1:35343/x/y?z=1 utf8=yes
